  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nWhen creating a room via the `/createRoom` endpoint and you try to set an `initial_state` with a non-member event that has the state key of an mxid you get `M_FORBIDDEN`: You are not allowed to set others state.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"invite\": [\"@alice:matrix.org\"],\r\n  \"initial_state\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"type\": \"com.example.custom\",\r\n      \"state_key\": \"@alice:matrix.org\",\r\n      \"content\": {\"blah\": \"blubb\"},\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- create a room that contains a default state event with the state key of an mxid\r\n\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Homeserver**: matrix.org\r\n",
